    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A superb three bedroom mid terrace house situated in a quiet cul-de-sac in this mature and very popular residential location. The property has gone through a complete refurbishment and is now on the market in show house condition. Located on one of Cork’s most popular Northside estates all amenities are close by to include schools, sports facilities, supermarkets and Mayfield Shopping Centre which is only five minutes away The 208 bus stop is directly across the road taking you to the City Centre, Bishopstown and CUH."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR\r\nHALLWAY\r\nSolid Wood Floor, Understairs Storage, Radiator, Power Points.\r\nLIVING ROOM    16.3 x 8.9\r\nSolid Wood Floor, Fitted Electric Fire, Radiator, Blinds, Power Points.\r\nLOUNGE    15.0 x 14.00                                                                                                                             \r\nSolid Wood Floor, Fitted Electric Fire, Radiator, Power Points.\r\nKITCHEN/ DINING ROOM    21.5 x 10.6                                                                                                                                       \r\nSolid Wood Floor, Wall & Floor Units, Integrated for  Electric Hob, Double Oven, Microwave, and \r\nWashing Machine, Extractor Fan, Fridge Freezer, Recessed Ceiling Lights, Sliding Patio \r\nDoors to courtyard, Radiator, Blinds, Power Points.\r\nSTAIRS & LANDING\r\nCarpet.\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\nBEDROOM 1    15.0 x 10.8                   \r\nCarpet, Fitted Wardrobes, Radiator, Blinds, Power Points.\r\nBEDROOM 2    15.1 x 7.4 \r\nOak Wood Floor, Fitted Wardrobes, Radiator, Blinds, Power Points.\r\nBEDROOM 3    11.10 x 7.4                   \r\nCarpet, Fitted Wardrobes, Radiator, Blinds, Power Points.\r\nBATHROOM    9.0 x 7.10                    \r\nCeramic Tile Floor, W.C., W.H.B., Shower Cubicle, Hot Towel Rail, Recessed Ceiling Lights, \r\nRadiator, Fully Tiled."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "SERVICES\r\nMains Water/Drainage, E.S.B, Telephone\r\nHEATING\r\nGas Fired Central Heating System\r\nWINDOWS\r\nDouble Glazed PVC Windows\r\nOUTSIDE/OTHER\r\nTotal Floor Area  104.5 sq m (1124 sq.ft).\r\nEnclosed Rear Courtyard. \r\nGarden Shed.     \r\nPrivate Parking.\r\nCombi Gas Boiler."
      },
